sequenceDiagram
    participant VPN as VPN Connection
    participant Kernel as Linux Kernel
    participant Monitor as VpnInterfaceMonitor
    participant EventBus as EventBus
    participant Mgr as MavExtenderManager
    participant Ext as Extender Thread
    participant Router as MavRouter (Primary)

    VPN->>Kernel: Create TUN interface (e.g. wg-1)
    Kernel-->>Monitor: Netlink RTNL: interface created
    Monitor->>EventBus: Publish InterfaceCreated event
    Kernel-->>Monitor: Netlink RTNL: interface UP
    Monitor->>EventBus: Publish InterfaceUp event

    VPN->>Kernel: Assign IP 10.0.0.2/24 to wg-1
    Kernel-->>Monitor: Netlink RTNL: address added
    Monitor->>EventBus: Publish AddressAdded (10.0.0.2)

    EventBus->>Mgr: VpnInterfaceEvent received
    Mgr->>Ext: Spawn extender thread
    Note over Ext: UDP client to router at 10.0.0.1:14580

    Ext->>Router: Connect UDP to 10.0.0.1:14580
    Router-->>Ext: MAVLink heartbeat exchange
    Mgr->>EventBus: Publish ExtenderStarted

    Note over Ext,Router: Extender relays telemetry
    Note over Ext,Router: between FC and GCS over VPN

    VPN->>Kernel: Remove TUN interface (disconnect)
    Kernel-->>Monitor: Netlink RTNL: address removed
    Monitor->>EventBus: Publish AddressRemoved
    EventBus->>Mgr: VpnInterfaceEvent received
    Mgr->>Ext: Stop and teardown extender
    Mgr->>EventBus: Publish ExtenderStopped
